        "TileImage": "$($repository 1af43e4a-5b91-45f4-8374-0a4e059adacc).Image",
        "Description": "The last target wasn&apos;t marked lol.So basically you poison the dude behind you after spawning, then eliminate the second dude in the room and hide them.Then go up the ladder,on the vents,shoot the camera for extra time,go down(if the 2 guards turn at it just crouch run so they don&apos;t spot you)and sneak to the music thing.It will only distract the target.Eliminate it and then you can exit.You can just go,not climb anything because the 2 guards don&apos;t see you if you run past them fast enough.Ez xp :)",
